      {
        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Find and Replace\n\nSwaps one substring for another across a block of text. The find and replace terms are inputs, so the same graph can be called from the API without editing it.\n\n**How it works:** \"Text\", \"Find\" and \"Replace with\" all feed \"Replace\", a Code node that replaces every occurrence of the search term. \"Result\" shows the edited text. With the defaults, \"lazy\" becomes \"energetic\". It runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Set \"Find\" to \"o\" and \"Replace with\" to \"0\" to confirm it replaces every occurrence, not only the first."
        },
